comment_data.body:
Roughly tested solution:
```diff
diff --git a/src/nvim/winfloat.c b/src/nvim/winfloat.c
index 82ccfa9be2..83d50b400f 100644
--- a/src/nvim/winfloat.c
+++ b/src/nvim/winfloat.c
@@ -188,6 +188,7 @@ void win_config_float(win_T *wp, WinConfig fconfig)
   wp->w_height = MAX(fconfig.height, 1);

   if (fconfig.relative == kFloatRelativeCursor) {
+    validate_cursor(curwin);
     fconfig.relative = kFloatRelativeWindow;
     fconfig.row += curwin->w_wrow;
     fconfig.col += curwin->w_wcol;
```

I'm not sure if it will lead to unexpected side effects.
